<title>UK: BayerVB sets 5.0 billion Czech crown two-year bond.</title>
<headline>BayerVB sets 5.0 billion Czech crown two-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Bayerische Vereinsbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BAYERISCHE VEREINSBANK OVERSEAS NV</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  BAYERISCHE VEREINSBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    5.0 BLN CZK   COUPON     10.625    MATURITY    10.FEB.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.95    PAY DATE    10.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.25	REOFFER    99.90     SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA+	 DENOMS (K) 25-100    SALE LIMITS US/UK/CZ</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    MGT/UND    0.20	SELL CONC   1.05</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
